{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04098","headline":"夜闻故梓州韦使君明当引绋感而成章 · 苏頲","name":"夜闻故梓州韦使君明当引绋感而成章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恻矣南邻问，冥然东岱幽。\n里閈宁相杵，朝叹忽迁舟。\n君心惟伯仲，吾人复款游。\n对连时亦早，交喜岁才周。\n序发扶阳赠，文因司寇酬。\n讵期危露尽，相续逝川流。\n卧疾无三吊，居闲有百忧。\n振风吟鼓夕，明月照帷秋。\n藓驳题诗馆，杨疎奏伎楼。\n共将歌笑叹，转爲弟兄留。\n感物存如梦，观生去若浮。\n余非忘情者，雪涕报林丘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}